  "details": "Every time I buy credits, no matter how many, I get spammed with the bell icon on my hud and a tab on top of my quick menu, other notifications, for DAYS every 20 minutes to an hour or so. It is so annoying, and I can't seem to find anyone else that has had this issue. It has persisted for me since credits first released, across multiple windows/vrc installs.\n\nI will note, that when a new one appears, the old one disappears from my notification history. So, I can only ever see one at a time. But they never stop coming.\n\nAttached screenshot to show purchase date and latest notification, they come every half hour/hour or so. Godawful.",
